    <h1>For the people who run toward the call. <em>One month free as a thank-you.</em></h1>
    <p>If you are a sworn police officer, firefighter, EMT, paramedic, 911 dispatcher, search-and-rescue volunteer, or wildland firefighter, whether currently active or retired, your second month with me is free. The first month at the standard $175 kicks off the build; the second month is on the house. Thank you for what you do.</p>
  </div>
